<title>AUSTRIA: OMV breakdown of H1 results by division.</title>
<headline>OMV breakdown of H1 results by division.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a divisional breakdown of earnings before interest and tax (EBIT) and sales of Austrian oil and chemicals group OMV AG in the half year to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>			    (in billions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Sales		  EBIT</p>
<p>Exploration &amp; Production     2.872 vs  2.776    0.417 vs 0.115</p>
<p>Gas				  6.196 vs  5.360    0.806 vs 0.913</p>
<p>Refinery &amp; Marketing	  37.727 vs 29.550    1.362 vs 0.120</p>
<p>Plastics			   5.344 vs  4.376    0.447 vs 0.237</p>
<p>Chemicals			  2.727 vs  2.631    0.283 vs 0.339</p>
<p>Corporate			  0.784 vs  0.130   -0.201 vs-0.209</p>
<p>TOTAL			     55.650 vs 44.823    3.114 vs 1.515</p>
<p>Oil tax			   10.338 vs  7.477    not applicable</p>
<p>TOTAL			     45.312 vs 37.346    3.114 vs 1.515</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +43 1 53112 258</p>
</text>
